# Quarter Turn needs no environment variables.
#
# It is a static PWA: no server, no database, no API keys, and nothing to
# configure at build or deploy time. Solve history, records and settings all
# live in IndexedDB on the device that made them, and never leave it.
#
# This file exists so that stays a deliberate, stated fact rather than
# something a future reader has to infer from an absent file.
